{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 1. Overall Experience\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 I explored the website and found it informative for anyone researching tractors before buying one.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 2. Issues and Suggestions\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 One problem I noticed is that some technical terms and specifications may be difficult for users who are not familiar with tractors. Adding short explanations beside these terms would help users understand what each feature means and why it matters.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 3. Positive Aspects\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 I liked that the website brings tractor specifications and model details together. The ability to explore different tractors and compare their features is especially useful when making a purchase decision.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 4. Overall Feedback\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Overall, I think the website is practical and informative. Making technical information easier to understand would help more users make confident decisions.\par}
